      "writtenOn": "2018-10-08T00:37:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The driving factor was to ensure response creation was isolated to the resource objects instead of in this code path. \n\nWhen we move OS-FEDERATION auth paths to being deprecated here, this code would live in keystone.api.auth instead of in a shared location.",
