        "id": 8482
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-07T17:39:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks like a slight change in behavior. Before this would throw an exception if there was not a valid unicode-encoded JSON body: https://github.com/Pylons/webob/blob/v1.8.2/src/webob/response.py#L587 Now it seems like silent\u003dTrue,force\u003dTrue will let that slide?",
      "revId": "4e9d7011ebc754178a07079bf1076f7e23109b26",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
